 "strings": {
  "There are too many pieces in play.": "",
  "It'd take the smallest push to start a war.": "",
  "Even if the Bakufu doesn't intend to enter one.": "",
  "A FEW DAYS LATER,\nKYO": "",
  "the time to use the Shinsengumi has come.": "",
  "The Satsuma and Choshu are still preparing\nfor war with the weapons you supplied them.": "",
  "\"If the people spill each other's blood,\nthen who's left to protect the country?\"": "",
  "What kind of retaliation\nwill their actions bring?": "",
  "Meanwhile, the other Sakamoto Ryoma\noperates from the shadows...": "",
  "This bold act also marks a declaration\nof war to the other Sakamoto Ryoma.": "",
  "And in doing so, they prevent all-out\nwar and promote the Meiji Restoration.": "",
  "And, together, they inched ever closer\nto freeing Japan from the Bakufu's rule.": "",
  "Ready to trigger the fall of the Bakufu\nin a war that would engulf all of Japan.": "",
  "Katsura Kogoro and Saigo Kichinosuke\nhad formed the \"Satcho Alliance.\"": "",
  "Kondo Isami warns:": "",
  "Ryoma, along with Okita Soji,\nstorm Edo Castle.": "",
  "Ryoma has yet to find out.": "",
  "Damn right! Those pale blue brutes\ntorched the whole town!": "",
  "What in the world are they thinking?": "",
  "Hey! Is it true? What you just said?": "",
  "You said Mibu Wolves...": "",
  "It can't be...": "",
  "What the hell's goin' on...?": "",
  "I saw it, he saw it—hell, we all saw it!": "",
  "Hajime-chan! Where ya goin'!?": "",
  "What do you mean, sir!?": "",
  "Damned Mibu Wolves!\nThis is the last straw!": "",
  "Are the Shinsengumi really behind this!?": "",
  "This is beyond madness!": "",
  "Setting the town ablaze!?\nThey've totally lost it!": "",
  "Kondo-san...": "",
  "Were we really too late?": "",
  "And you're not part of it.": "",
  "So long.": "",
  "You really got nothin' to say to me?": "",
  "Wait a minute!": "",
  "I don't.": "",
  "And why the hell not...?": "",
  "Not about my strength as a warrior?\nNothing at all?": "",
  "Help me up! Saito!": "",
  "Sakamoto... Ryoma?": "",
  "Because this is Sakamoto Ryoma's story.": "",
  "Forgive me, will you?": "",
  "\"I'll be waiting at the palace.\"": "",
  "entrusted me with your wills.": "",
  "You're not the one who\ngave the order, are you?": "",
  "I'm really glad": "",
  "For the first time in my life,": "",
  "Who attacked you?": "",
  "Hey! Stay with me!": "",
  "to give you a message.": "",
  "Take this letter.": "",
  "All I ever did was ask you for favors,\nand not once did I offer one in return.": "",
  "In other words,": "",
  "that we <i>can</i> change this country.": "",
  "he'll use the surrounding chaos\nto take the Emperor's life.": "",
  "Get yourself to the palace.": "",
  "In fact, he may very well be the other\nSakamoto Ryoma we'd been hearing about.　": "",
  "Hey... I know what you're thinking.": "",
  "to have met you.": "",
  "While the Shinsengumi burn down the capital...": "",
  "and ended up protecting\nthe place instead.": "",
  "I came to Kyo to burn it all down,": "",
  "I'm still going down in history as the\nguy who set the country ablaze...!": "",
  "What is it?": "",
  "You know something, Ryoma-san?": "",
  "You think... this whole mess\nwas my doing.": "",
  "Can you believe it?\nThey got me good.": "",
  "That's enough about me.": "",
  "On my honor, I'll find a way.\nI'll see your dream fulfilled.": "",
  "I changed too.": "",
  "And that fake Sakamoto Ryoma...\nBring him down!": "",
  "Not a clue. But the bastard told me...": "",
  "the Shinsengumi is being used.": "",
  "Sakamoto Ryoma!": "",
  "but then I met this\nSakamoto Ryoma character": "",
  "And I'll do it as Sakamoto Ryoma.": "",
  "Are you all right?\nWhat happened here?": "",
  "Now that imperial rule's being restored,\nI imagine his boys are getting restless.　": "",
  "His real target...": "",
  "is the Emperor.": "",
  "He's after the Emperor?": "",
  "leading to an all-out war between the\nBakufu and the Imperial Court.": "",
  "And since I'm on the Bakufu's side,\nthey'll pin the Emperor's death on me,": "",
  "The palace?": "",
  "Saito?": "",
  "Shinpachi...": "",
  "Japan...": "",
  "I've got one last favor to ask of you.": "",
  "final move.": "",
  "Your final... move?": "",
  "someone... actually made me believe...　": "",
  "You and Toyo-san both": "",
  "Toshi...": "",
  "Make sure Toshi gets it.": "",
  "Gen-san...": "",
  "Ironic, isn't it?　": "",
  "And even after all that,": "",
  "Soji...": "",
  "And I couldn't be prouder.": "",
  "Kondo...": "",
  "It's Kondo Isami's...": "",
  "All because I met a man\nnamed Kondo Isami.": "",
  "is in your hands...": "",
  "And on the other\nSakamoto Ryoma's orders...": "",
  "Very good.": "",
  "Who else!?": "",
  "I'll bet you thought Takechi-sensei\nwould be waiting here. Am I right?": "",
  "You're lying to yourself.　": "",
  "Turns out, you're just afraid.": "",
  "Fine, then.": "",
  "Was it you? All that\n\"other Sakamoto Ryoma\" business?": "",
  "Just what are you after, Izo?": "",
  "It's you...": "",
  "You've got your fight, Izo.": "",
  "and hatched this grand scheme myself?": "",
  "That's it, isn't it?": "",
  "Is that what you're getting at?": "",
  "From the look on your face,\nI'd say you're relieved.": "",
  "So, you think I sold Takechi-san\nto Yamauchi Yodo": "",
  "And even then...": "",
  "And this whole time...": "",
  "Why use my name? And for all of this?": "",
  "Why did you betray Takechi?": "",
  "Been a while, hasn't it, Party Rep?": "",
  "The story of Izo the Butcher is over.": "",
  "Izo...": "",
  "Tell me I'm wrong!": "",
  "Mark my words.": "",
  "But only if I take you on?": "",
  "So you'll admit everything...": "",
  "You know deep in your heart, the other\nSakamoto Ryoma is indeed Takechi-san.": "",
  "Not a bad deal, if you ask me.　": "",
  "After the Shinsengumi captured you,\nyou returned to Tosa and confessed...": "",
  "Getting caught by the Shinsengumi,\nand everything that followed...": "",
  "This has all just been part of the plan, hasn't it!?": "",
  "Really now?": "",
  "Now!": "",
  "You just can't accept the fact\nthat Takechi-san betrayed you.": "",
  "The two of you had a bond...": "",
  "Takechi took his own life because of you.": "",
  "It's time we settled this.": "",
  "I thought that bond was unbreakable!": "",
  "You don't want to know the truth.": "",
  "Me?": "",
  "All I ever wanted was a fight to the finish.": "",
  "Long have I waited, not to duel Saito Hajime,\nbut the real Sakamoto Ryoma.": "",
  "This is the final chapter.": "",
  "With pleasure...": "",
  "Betray Takechi?": "",
  "I cut down Kondo Isami\nand got exactly that.": "",
  "He's the other Sakamoto Ryoma.": "",
  "And it <i>is</i> him.": "",
  "is you...": "",
  "You're the only one...　": "",
  "I was never going to take\nyour place in his heart...": "",
  "waiting for you...": "",
  "who can accept him for all he is!": "",
  "I could never become his brother.": "",
  "He's been...": "",
  "The only one...": "",
  "I wonder...": "",
  "Are these the skies you dreamed of?": "",
  "Try to talk, Izo!": "",
  "for a long time.": "",
  "So please...": "",
  "Only you!": "",
  "I... I lost?": "",
  "glad to hear it...": "",
  "My brother—he's alive, isn't he?": "",
  "Got it.": "",
  "I promise, I won't let\nhim go any further!": "",
  "from which there is no coming back.": "",
  "who can stop him now...": "",
  "Takechi-san's in a place...": "",
  "Takechi-san is in Kyo.": "",
  "Takechi...": "",
  "I could never...": "",
  "Guess that means...": "",
  "That even with...\nall I've done for him...": "",
  "You're working with a certain\nSakamoto Ryoma, aren't you?": "",
  "I don't recall saying he was killed.": "",
  "You happen to know something\nthe rest of us don't.": "",
  "Ito-san!": "",
  "The Shinsengumi will continue long\nafter you've been purged from it,": "",
  "Kondo-san gave his life for us, and I\nwill see that his will is carried out.": "",
  "It'd be heresy to let the\nShinsengumi name fall any further.": "",
  "I never would've guessed this\nis how we'd say goodbye.": "",
  "Rest assured.": "",
  "Now then, if you would kindly\nstep aside, Deputy Chief.": "",
  "Yes, this is indeed a mystery.": "",
  "But even so, the Shinsengumi is still an\nauthority who answers to the Bakufu.": "",
  "What's more...": "",
  "Well said! Any candidate other than\nIto-san is a waste of time!": "",
  "There's no way in hell I'm\ncalling some rookie like him \"Chief\"!": "",
  "I feel its leader should possess\nknowledge, culture, morals, and insight.": "",
  "Be seeing you.": "",
  "That is, unless, Ito-san...": "",
  "And Sanosuke.": "",
  "Well now...": "",
  "You make a fair point.": "",
  "But that's nothing new, of course.": "",
  "Makes sense to me.": "",
  "So, as for our new chief...": "",
  "But in light of his death at the hands\nof some scum-of-the-earth ronin...": "",
  "Didn't have too much trouble\nconvincing them, though.": "",
  "This is peculiar, isn't it?": "",
  "Wait one minute! This is unheard of!": "",
  "In fact, I'd say it's crystal clear.": "",
  "I'm sorry, what!?": "",
  "Still, you say he's been killed.": "",
  "If I may ask something,\nDeputy Chief, sir?": "",
  "Hajime-chan's stronger than\nevery last one of us.": "",
  "You seemed rather certain it was\nsome \"scum-of-the-earth ronin.\"": "",
  "Killing Ito-san's not the best idea.\nThings might get messy.": "",
  "As of today, we take our leave and\nform a new organization: the Goryo Eji.": "",
  "Ito-san?": "",
  "Figured a little strategy'd be enough to\nmake the Shinsengumi mine, but no luck.": "",
  "I take it you have a problem?": "",
  "What is?": "",
  "And just what are you implying!?": "",
  "That's half of our captains. And seeing\nas our chief is still absent,": "",
  "What a drag.": "",
  "Yamanami.": "",
  "Heisuke...": "",
  "Heisuke, you too!?": "",
  "Only natural he takes the lead.": "",
  "Saito's barely just arrived!\nHe hasn't been here near long enough!": "",
  "I'd like to appoint Saito Hajime-kun.": "",
  "What do you say, Saito-kun?": "",
  "So what if he's new to the pack?": "",
  "The Shinsengumi served its purpose,\nbut it's time to move on, Hijikata-san.": "",
  "I feel it may be difficult to continue\nthe Shinsengumi as we are now.": "",
  "And here I thought I'd be\nShinsengumi till the day I die.": "",
  "I, Ito Kashitaro, will safeguard against\nthis, as the Shinsengumi's next chief.": "",
  "Matsubara.": "",
  "I wish you the very best with whatever\nyou manage to scrape together.": "",
  "Gen-san.": "",
  "There's no doubting Saito-kun's skill\nwith a sword. Even I will admit that.": "",
  "I simply mentioned the Chief's absence.": "",
  "What you said about Chief Kondo.": "",
  "No answer, I see.\nThen, does that mean...": "",
  "Just how it goes.": "",
  "You had this all planned out, I see.": "",
  "You've been lying through your teeth?": "",
  "How dare you, Hijikata!": "",
  "Of course. I humbly accept.": "",
  "Tani.": "",
  "and everything Chief Kondo Isami\nestablished will remain.": "",
  "Chief Kondo had all these things in spades.": ""
 },
 "ref_ja": {
  "There are too many pieces in play.": "少し面倒なことになったな",
