  "And, together, they inched ever closer\nto freeing Japan from the Bakufu's rule.": "幕府打倒へと\n大きく歴史を動かそうとしていた",
  "Ready to trigger the fall of the Bakufu\nin a war that would engulf all of Japan.": "日本中を戦火に包む\n倒幕戦争の引き金に指をかける",
  "Katsura Kogoro and Saigo Kichinosuke\nhad formed the \"Satcho Alliance.\"": "桂小五郎と西郷吉之助による「薩長同盟」は",
  "Kondo Isami warns:": "近藤勇はいう",
  "Ryoma, along with Okita Soji,\nstorm Edo Castle.": "龍馬は　沖田総司とともに江戸城を襲撃し",
  "Ryoma has yet to find out.": "龍馬はまだ知らない",
  "Damn right! Those pale blue brutes\ntorched the whole town!": "ああせや！！\nあの浅葱色の連中が方々で火ぃつけて回っとる！",
  "What in the world are they thinking?": "あいつら一体何のつもりやねん",
  "Hey! Is it true? What you just said?": "おい　今の話　本当なのか！？",
  "You said Mibu Wolves...": "これが壬生狼……",
  "It can't be...": "そんな……",
  "What the hell's goin' on...?": "どういうこっちゃ……",
  "I saw it, he saw it—hell, we all saw it!": "ウチも　こいつも\n皆見とるんや！！",
  "Hajime-chan! Where ya goin'!?": "一（はじめ）ちゃんどこ行くんや！？",
  "What do you mean, sir!?": "何ですかお侍はん！？",
  "Damned Mibu Wolves!\nThis is the last straw!": "壬生狼め\nとうとうやりおった！",
  "Are the Shinsengumi really behind this!?": "新選組の仕業だってのか！？",
  "This is beyond madness!": "無茶苦茶にも程があるわ！",
  "Setting the town ablaze!?\nThey've totally lost it!": "町に火ぃつけて回るなんて\n狂気の沙汰や！",
  "Kondo-san...": "近藤さん……",
  "Were we really too late?": "間に合わなかったってのか？",
  "And you're not part of it.": "お前の名は　必要ない",
  "So long.": "さらばだ",
  "You really got nothin' to say to me?": "ちょっとくらいねぇのか",
  "Wait a minute!": "ちょっと待て！",
  "I don't.": "ない",
  "And why the hell not...?": "何だよそれ……",
  "Not about my strength as a warrior?\nNothing at all?": "俺の腕前はどうだったとか\n言い残すことはよ……？",
  "Help me up! Saito!": "助けてくれ！！　斎藤！！",
  "Sakamoto... Ryoma?": "坂本　龍馬……！？",
  "Because this is Sakamoto Ryoma's story.": "坂本龍馬の歴史に",
  "Forgive me, will you?": "……すまねぇな",
  "\"I'll be waiting at the palace.\"": "「御所で待つ」と",
  "entrusted me with your wills.": "あんたから託されたことを",
  "You're not the one who\ngave the order, are you?": "あんたが新選組に命じたんじゃねえんだな？",
  "I'm really glad": "あんたに会えて……",
  "For the first time in my life,": "あんたに会って初めて",
  "Who attacked you?": "あんた誰にやられた？",
  "Hey! Stay with me!": "おい　しっかりしろ！",
  "to give you a message.": "お前に伝えろと言われた",
  "Take this letter.": "この手紙を……",
  "All I ever did was ask you for favors,\nand not once did I offer one in return.": "これまで頼みごとばかりで\nアンタにゃ何ひとつしてやれなかった",
  "In other words,": "じゃあ新選組は",
  "that we <i>can</i> change this country.": "そう思うことができたぜ",
  "he'll use the surrounding chaos\nto take the Emperor's life.": "その隙を狙って帝の命を奪う肚だ",
  "Get yourself to the palace.": "それより御所へ",
  "In fact, he may very well be the other\nSakamoto Ryoma we'd been hearing about.　": "もしかしたらあの男が\n“もう一人の坂本龍馬”なのかもしれねえ　",
  "Hey... I know what you're thinking.": "よぉ　お前こう思ってたんじゃねえのか",
  "to have met you.": "よかったと思ってる",
  "While the Shinsengumi burn down the capital...": "京の街を　新選組の手で焼かせて",
  "and ended up protecting\nthe place instead.": "京の街を守る道を選んだっていうのによ",
  "I came to Kyo to burn it all down,": "京の街を焼こうとして京に上った俺が",
  "I'm still going down in history as the\nguy who set the country ablaze...!": "京を焼いた男として\n歴史に名を刻んじまうんだからな……！",
  "What is it?": "なんだ？",
  "You know something, Ryoma-san?": "俺ぁよ　龍馬さん",
  "You think... this whole mess\nwas my doing.": "俺が　京に火をつけたってよ",
  "Can you believe it?\nThey got me good.": "俺としたことが\n斬られちまったよ",
  "That's enough about me.": "俺のことはもういい",
  "On my honor, I'll find a way.\nI'll see your dream fulfilled.": "俺は必ず　俺のやり方で\nあんた達の意志を継ぐ",
  "I changed too.": "俺も……",
  "And that fake Sakamoto Ryoma...\nBring him down!": "偽の坂本龍馬を　止めてくれ！",
  "Not a clue. But the bastard told me...": "分からねぇ\nだがその男に……",
  "the Shinsengumi is being used.": "利用されたというわけか",
  "Sakamoto Ryoma!": "坂本龍馬……！",
  "but then I met this\nSakamoto Ryoma character": "坂本龍馬という男に出会ったことで……",
  "And I'll do it as Sakamoto Ryoma.": "坂本龍馬としてな",
  "Are you all right?\nWhat happened here?": "大丈夫か？　何があったんだ",
  "Now that imperial rule's being restored,\nI imagine his boys are getting restless.　": "大政奉還が成った今\n連中は焦ってるはずだ　",
  "His real target...": "奴の狙いは……",
  "is the Emperor.": "帝だ",
  "He's after the Emperor?": "帝の命を……！",
  "leading to an all-out war between the\nBakufu and the Imperial Court.": "幕府と朝廷の戦争を仕掛けるのが目的だろう",
  "And since I'm on the Bakufu's side,\nthey'll pin the Emperor's death on me,": "幕府側の俺を\n帝暗殺の犯人に見せかけて……",
  "The palace?": "御所だと？",
  "Saito?": "斎藤か……",
  "Shinpachi...": "新八……",
  "Japan...": "日本を……",
  "I've got one last favor to ask of you.": "最期にもうひとつ\n俺の頼みを聞いてくれ",
  "final move.": "最期の“策”だ",
  "Your final... move?": "最期の　策……",
  "someone... actually made me believe...　": "本当に\nこの国を変えられるんじゃねえかと……　",
  "You and Toyo-san both": "東洋の親っさん　それに",
  "Toshi...": "歳……",
  "Make sure Toshi gets it.": "歳に渡してやってくれ",
  "Gen-san...": "源さん……",
  "Ironic, isn't it?　": "皮肉な話だな　",
  "And even after all that,": "結局最後は",
  "Soji...": "総司……",
  "And I couldn't be prouder.": "誇りに思う",
  "Kondo...": "近藤",
  "It's Kondo Isami's...": "近藤勇",
  "All because I met a man\nnamed Kondo Isami.": "近藤勇という男に出会って\n変わっちまった",
  "is in your hands...": "頼んだぜ",
  "And on the other\nSakamoto Ryoma's orders...": "“もう一人の坂本龍馬”に命令され",
  "Very good.": "ああ",
  "Who else!?": "ああそうだ！",
  "I'll bet you thought Takechi-sensei\nwould be waiting here. Am I right?": "あなたはここに　武市先生が待っていると\n思っていたんじゃありませんか？",
  "You're lying to yourself.　": "あなたは嘘をついている　",
  "Turns out, you're just afraid.": "あなたは怖がっている",
  "Fine, then.": "いいだろう",
  "Was it you? All that\n\"other Sakamoto Ryoma\" business?": "お前が\n“もう一人の坂本龍馬”だったのか？",
  "Just what are you after, Izo?": "お前の目的はなんだ以蔵",
  "It's you...": "お前は",
  "You've got your fight, Izo.": "これで終わりだ以蔵",
  "and hatched this grand scheme myself?": "こんな計画を仕掛けたと",
  "That's it, isn't it?": "そうなんでしょう？",
