  "Killing Ito-san's not the best idea.\nThings might get messy.": "今伊東さんを殺されたら\nいろいろ困るんでね",
  "As of today, we take our leave and\nform a new organization: the Goryo Eji.": "今日から俺らは「御陵衛士」という\n新たな組織として独立する",
  "Ito-san?": "伊東さん",
  "Figured a little strategy'd be enough to\nmake the Shinsengumi mine, but no luck.": "体よく新選組を\n奪い取るつもりだったが仕方ねえ",
  "I take it you have a problem?": "何か問題でも？",
  "What is?": "何がだ",
  "And just what are you implying!?": "何を言ってるんだ　君は……！",
  "That's half of our captains. And seeing\nas our chief is still absent,": "半数の隊長格を失い　局長も不在の今",
  "What a drag.": "参ったな",
  "Yamanami.": "山南",
  "Heisuke...": "平助……",
  "Heisuke, you too!?": "平助　お前！",
  "Only natural he takes the lead.": "強いヤツが頭を張る",
  "Saito's barely just arrived!\nHe hasn't been here near long enough!": "斎藤はちょっと前に入ってきたばかりの\n新参モンやないか！",
  "I'd like to appoint Saito Hajime-kun.": "斎藤一君に託そうと思う",
  "What do you say, Saito-kun?": "斎藤君　どうかね？",
  "So what if he's new to the pack?": "新参モンでもええやないか",
  "The Shinsengumi served its purpose,\nbut it's time to move on, Hijikata-san.": "新選組の役割はもう終わったんだよ\n土方さん",
  "I feel it may be difficult to continue\nthe Shinsengumi as we are now.": "新選組をこのまま続けていくことは\n難しいと考えている",
  "And here I thought I'd be\nShinsengumi till the day I die.": "新選組を抜ける時は\n死ぬ時だと思ってたのに",
  "I, Ito Kashitaro, will safeguard against\nthis, as the Shinsengumi's next chief.": "新選組次期局長は\nこの伊東甲子太郎が引き受けよう",
  "Matsubara.": "松原",
  "I wish you the very best with whatever\nyou manage to scrape together.": "残り少ない隊士たちと一緒に\nせいぜい頑張るんだな",
  "Gen-san.": "源さん……",
  "There's no doubting Saito-kun's skill\nwith a sword. Even I will admit that.": "確かに斎藤君は剣の腕が立つ\nそれは私も認める",
  "I simply mentioned the Chief's absence.": "私は局長が不在だと言ったまでです",
  "What you said about Chief Kondo.": "私は近藤局長が……",
  "No answer, I see.\nThen, does that mean...": "答えられない　ということは……",
  "Just how it goes.": "自然の成り行きやないか",
  "You had this all planned out, I see.": "裏切る手筈も整えていたか",
  "You've been lying through your teeth?": "認めるということかな？",
  "How dare you, Hijikata!": "謀ったな　土方……！",
